    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Description\n\nI use mini.icons as standalone package. I tried both mapping Nerd Font Symbols only font or using patched JetBrains Mono font still get same results. I use latest Nerd Font version 3.2 + Kitty terminal emulator.\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Install JetBrains Mono Nerd from archlinux repo\r\n2. Setup mini.icons with lazy.nvim\r\n3. Open project with .git, .github folder, containing yml and yaml files\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nDifferent icons for folders like .git, .github. Correct icons for yaml, yml files not exclamation mark.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d202be18-515d-4ad2-bab8-ec1bb5b0a2d0)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3d13a5c-df96-4702-882a-d3a6009abcff)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1889112d-2dd1-4515-8701-671c16d507dc)\r\n",
